I see there are two locations where `hasDifferentLiveSessionModelSelection` is checked:
1. Before the attempt (around line 472-486) - this is where I added my fix
2. After a failed attempt (around line 648-658) - I also added `!isBackgroundTrigger` here but NOT the `isSessionOverrideCurrent` check

The second location is checking after a failed attempt. Let me think about whether the second location needs the same fix...

At line 648-658:
```typescript
const persistedSelection =
  failedOrAbortedAttempt && !isBackgroundTrigger && shouldTrackPersistedLiveSelection
    ? resolvePersistedLiveSelection()
    : null;
if (
  failedOrAbortedAttempt &&
  !isBackgroundTrigger &&
